```text
IF (age < 30)
{
   price ← 5
}
ELSE
{
   IF (member)
   {
      price ← 8
   }
   ELSE
   {
      IF (age ≥ 45)
      {
         price ← 7
      }
      ELSE
      {
         price ← 12
      }
   }
}
DISPLAY (price)
```

What is displayed when age is 66 and member is true?

